'''Valkyrie Cat's Trial''' (ネコヴァルキリー大試練, ''Neko Varukirī Daishiren'', '''Cat Valkyrie Great Trial''') is a special stage that was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]] and appears after clearing [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 1. After beating Valkyrie Cat's Trial, it disappears permanently and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]]'s [[Talents]] can be unlocked. [[Bahamut Cat's Trial]] appears after beating both Cats of the Cosmos Chapter 2 and Valkyrie Cat's Trial.

